* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
* COPYCODE: CCAUDIT
* SYSTEM:   SIFAP - PAYMENT INSPECTION AND ADMINISTRATION SYSTEM
* AUTHOR:   ADILSON BATISTA
* DATE:     15/04/2005
* CHANGED:  09/02/2012 - FERNANDA OLIVEIRA - ADD TS-EVENT
* CHANGED:  10/07/2015 - ANDERSON LIMA     - ADD BATCH CONTEXT
* PURPOSE:  STANDARD BLOCK FOR WRITING THE AUDIT TRAIL
*           TO FILE 153 (AUDIT). REQUIRED IN EVERY
*           MODULE THAT CHANGES DATA - IN-TCU 63/2010.
*           PROVIDES THE WRITE-AUDIT SUBROUTINE.
*
* USE:      1. DECLARE THE VIEW AND REQUIRED FIELDS BELOW
*           2. LOAD #AUD-ACTION / #AUD-ENTITY / #AUD-ID /
*              #AUD-CPF / #AUD-DESCR
*           3. PERFORM WRITE-AUDIT
*           4. PLACE "INCLUDE CCAUDIT" AT THE END OF THE MODULE,
*              IN THE SUBROUTINE AREA, BEFORE "END"
*
* REQUIRED VIEW IN THE INCLUDING MODULE'S DEFINE DATA:
*           1 AUDIT-V VIEW OF AUDIT
*             2 NUM-AUDIT              (N15)
*             2 DT-EVENT               (N8)
*             2 HR-EVENT               (N6)
*             2 TS-EVENT               (N14)
*             2 COD-ACTION             (A2)
*             2 COD-MODULE             (A8)
*             2 DESCR-ACTION           (A80)
*             2 TYPE-ENTITY            (A4)
*             2 ID-ENTITY              (A15)
*             2 NUM-CPF-AFFECTED       (A11)
*             2 USR-EVENT              (A8)
*             2 NAME-JOB-BATCH         (A16)
*             2 STAT-BATCH             (A1)
*
* REQUIRED FIELDS IN THE INCLUDING MODULE'S DEFINE DATA:
*           1 #AUD-ACTION       (A2)   /* IN IN/AL/EX/BT/ER
*           1 #AUD-ENTITY       (A4)   /* IN BENF/PGTO/PROG/SIST
*           1 #AUD-ID           (A15)  /* IN ENTITY KEY
*           1 #AUD-CPF          (A11)  /* IN AFFECTED CPF OR BLANK
*           1 #AUD-DESCR        (A80)  /* IN FREE TEXT
*           1 #AUD-SEQ          (N15)  /* WORK - SEED
*           1 #AUD-TIMN         (N7)   /* WORK - *TIMN
*
* NOTE 1:   ACTION 'CO' (QUERY) MUST NOT BE RECORDED SINCE
*           2010 DUE TO VOLUME - PORT. CGTI 213/2010.
*           THIS ROUTINE DOES NOT BLOCK 'CO'; BLOCKING IS
*           THE CALLER'S RESPONSIBILITY. TICKET 7740.
*
* NOTE 2:   THE DDM FIELD COD-PROFILE IS NOT POPULATED BY
*           THIS ROUTINE. TICKET 7742 - OPEN.
*
* NOTE 3:   THIS COPYCODE DOES NOT CONTAIN ON ERROR - NATURAL
*           ALLOWS ONLY ONE ON ERROR BLOCK PER OBJECT, AND IT
*           BELONGS TO THE CALLING MODULE.
*
* NOTE 4:   THE ROUTINE DOES NOT ISSUE END TRANSACTION.
*           TRANSACTION CONTROL BELONGS TO THE CALLING MODULE.
* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
DEFINE SUBROUTINE WRITE-AUDIT
*
  RESET AUDIT-V
*
* SEQUENCE SEED - READ ONLY ONCE PER EXECUTION
  IF #AUD-SEQ = 0
    READ (1) AUDIT-V BY NUM-AUDIT DESCENDING
      MOVE AUDIT-V.NUM-AUDIT TO #AUD-SEQ
    END-READ
    RESET AUDIT-V
  END-IF
  ADD 1 TO #AUD-SEQ
*
* DATE AND TIME STAMP
* *TIMN RETURNS N7 (HHMMSST) - THE DDM STORES N6 (HHMMSS)
  MOVE *DATN TO AUDIT-V.DT-EVENT
  MOVE *TIMN TO #AUD-TIMN
  DIVIDE 10 INTO #AUD-TIMN GIVING AUDIT-V.HR-EVENT
  COMPUTE AUDIT-V.TS-EVENT =
          (AUDIT-V.DT-EVENT * 1000000)
        +  AUDIT-V.HR-EVENT
*
* EVENT IDENTIFICATION
  MOVE #AUD-SEQ       TO AUDIT-V.NUM-AUDIT
  MOVE #AUD-ACTION      TO AUDIT-V.COD-ACTION
  MOVE *PROGRAM       TO AUDIT-V.COD-MODULE
  MOVE #AUD-DESCR TO AUDIT-V.DESCR-ACTION
  MOVE #AUD-ENTITY  TO AUDIT-V.TYPE-ENTITY
  MOVE #AUD-ID        TO AUDIT-V.ID-ENTITY
  MOVE #AUD-CPF       TO AUDIT-V.NUM-CPF-AFFECTED
  MOVE *USER          TO AUDIT-V.USR-EVENT
*
* BATCH CONTEXT - POPULATED ONLY WHEN ACTION = 'BT'
  IF #AUD-ACTION = 'BT'
    MOVE *INIT-USER TO AUDIT-V.NAME-JOB-BATCH
    MOVE 'S'        TO AUDIT-V.STAT-BATCH
  END-IF
*
  STORE AUDIT-V
*
END-SUBROUTINE
